{"text": "Tyler Pokela\n\nMy goal in any job is to prove my loyalty and quality of work with the utmost discretion.\n\nam experienced in completing large projects by dissecting the objective, delegating tasks, and\nensuring the results meet strict standards of integrity. | am willing to put the full force of my\nexperience behind my work while maintaining the willingness to learn new techniques and\ndevelop new skillsets.\n\nCareer\n\nData Team Lead | Ohio Republican Party\n\nAugust 2016 - November 2016 | Columbus, OH\n\nManage Team of 3 Data Coordinators\n\u00a9 Trained and supervised all department employees.\no Delegated and prioritized all tasks\nManaged Absentee Data Program\no Designed and implemented data collection systems\no Reported findings and data overviews to State Director\nVendor Relations\no Sent bug reports and requests to vendors\no Designated as vendor point of contact for mobile device and web-based data\ncollection systems.\nCall Center Maintenance\n\u00a9 Set up and maintained 15+ call centers across Ohio\n\u00a9 Created and deployed targeted call lists and surveys\nNetworking and Security\no Set up and maintained over one dozen secure office networks\no Managed network setup and maintenance for multiple call centers\nGOTV (Get-Out-The-Vote) and Election Day Operations Support\no Worked with campaign staff to set up and operate our \u201cWar Room\u201d, the election\nday headquarters\no Worked with large telecom providers such as AT&T in negotiating rates and\nimplementing a large and responsive communication system",
